draftProposal.prompt:
Write a formal project proposal document with these details:

Project: {project_name}
Client: {client}
Budget: {budget}
Timeline: {timeline}
Objective: {objective}
Deliverables: {deliverables}
Out of scope: {out_of_scope}

Include these sections: Executive Summary, Objectives, Scope, Deliverables, Timeline Overview, Budget Summary. Use professional business language.

finalProposal.prompt:
Revise this project proposal based on the review notes. If the note is APPROVE, return it unchanged.

Review notes: {approval_notes}

Proposal:
{proposal}
